OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds more homes planned for
OL,4,Atown
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for 360 homes on the outskirts of
OL,7,Fa market town are due to move forward
OL,8,Fdespite concerns about their impact on
OL,9,Fnature and traffic.
OL,11,FParish councils have objected to the
OL,12,Fplans for an estate south of Dereham in
OL,13,FNorfolk, while the town council said it
OL,14,Fwanted more information from the
OL,15,Fdevelopers.
OL,17,FThe proposals - put forward by the
OL,18,FHolkham Estates Company (HEC) ` include
OL,19,Fa mixture of houses, apartments and
OL,20,Fbungalows, with 90 due to be
OL,21,F"affordable".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
